    {
      "id": "0ac6a556-cd5b-444a-87c5-5abc2c1fde90",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e observe que a frase ainda não fala do problema, só da base do processo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "661ab5f9-a5bd-4bef-a779-11d105472c42",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>funciona con</strong> ajuda a explicar com que recurso um produto ou serviço opera.</p><p>Aqui o foco não está no problema ainda, e sim na base do processo: app + código QR.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7e4af707-b681-4cfa-9240-3e6aa1cc37aa",
      "title": "Escute a frase e observe como ela responde para que o sistema existe na prática.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1e29fc88-3525-4a75-9d88-c20a0fe701b9",
          "textContent": "<p>Depois aparece a função principal do sistema.</p><p><strong>Sirve para desbloquear la bicicleta y registrar el trayecto.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Serve para destravar a bicicleta e registrar o trajeto.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/972a6ec299f84d38b39d50845658e587_b02-bike-share-qr-realistic-v2.png?Expires=1794099743&Signature=r4QTZiE8IcjLCckczEELoSN9KtprF-K5gNnp7dKWWwqMYDCpwxVeblZz3gLp6aHLrJflf3SQkxKz~N1pN81RF4PL~QJOqMlqPi~FAuxuRnVcx-6uYTIDWykmzZQOdNKw0JV5KZIz26PoOez~H~137YZOYFJgt7cNgROfO0eWAvBetK0ZMvlwmGGvubRTBWtjIlvQqThu2-MPsFpOHcEmjjNiWdCsrZdBS6eEMIEvHjg7TtWiFoHpYiZvnah9h8EHYA-oFdX5-Ilm2vjvygtmBeULckXgzfAdIosTDXIg2475hdXNvTJznBfhMk8HOrO8ERiA2abfi9ucw~wPXYTQbA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8af4f11685954bff9886df17b5def598_b04-sirve-para-desbloquear-la-bicicleta-y-registrar-el-trayecto.mp3?Expires=1794099743&Signature=HA9wnCmEashgOs0IImx3YiMQz1TldrSl6yeB4qhXHi3wqyLHXoNQ8yctxODB6NWLP7gycON7R93KFAypg3psF~1WGjsVuVzsZPPshANGcvDeJkDHNG-9aSmcjKCg~Jy2DXKp4tDowT4-uwOozeHSnvj99N8z4abT3-VuilxUxoXt3SdeFeppAgNKI2iXdaNFvHHeEw4tkbBqwdPaHdkK9GH8euiS5Ifff0f-ZOS~~5fzqDFzG3zfrE8-JiPmRLnPtijkp5qRF2PElckRC8hMn2qg7dez9e6sNQBq6c8~qVW3LjzPOUYuP~-c1ASIlLlDOSmhdTJc~RmAGvKb7sVRBA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
